{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>觀塘成業工業大廈一個單位，懷疑被用作動物養殖場，發現29具爬行類等動物屍體。</p><p></p><p>單位負責人於早上約十點半報案，指與住戶失聯，進入單位後發現大量動物屍體。警方到場發現20隻龜、兩條魚及7隻蜥蜴的屍體。懷疑動物缺水缺糧而死，被不恰當對待。愛護動物協會人員亦到場。</p><p></p><p>案件列殘酷對待動物，交由觀塘警區重案組跟進。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:21:47.655128+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:34:58.583929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:21.755021+00:00","content_hash":"64a75e073c1fbe2073d2dfe06dff6e667a061241073d708e02948e884931e199","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:21:47.655128+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}